sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant A as Access edge
    participant G as Gateway
    participant D as guacd / Mac
    B->>A: Node URL, approved email OTP
    A->>G: Bootstrap with signed assertion
    G-->>B: Host-only app cookie + CSRF
    B->>G: POST connect intent (cookie + CSRF; edge JWT)
    G-->>B: Owner-bound intent ID, expires in 30s
    B->>G: WebSocket upgrade (exact Origin + cookie; edge JWT)
    G->>G: Validate + atomic consume + controller lease
    G->>D: Fixed target + server-owned credential
    D-->>B: Desktop via guacd / gateway
    Note over G,D: Server deadline, input idle and revoke apply while streaming
    B->>G: End / logout
    G->>D: Close upstream, release lease
    G-->>B: Ended; no input replay on reconnect
